#
# VS 2017 BuildTools
#  Workload : Visual C++ Build Tools
#  Components: Windows 10 SDK (10.0.17763.0) + VC++2017 version 15.9 v14.16 latest v141 tools
#            + Visual C++ Build Tools のコア機能 + Visual Studio C++ コア機能 
